# Gitallow: deny everything, then allow tracked content explicitly.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!justfile
!profile/
!profile/README.md

# Visual identity: the generator, its environment and its output.
# brand/Manifest.toml stays ignored.
!brand/
!brand/Project.toml
!brand/README.md
!brand/make_brand.jl
!brand/assets/
!brand/assets/**
